title: "Exact Gaussian Approximation for Products of Arbitrarily Many Gaussian Matrices"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For independent real iid Gaussian matrices, the total variation limit of the normalized full matrix product is governed by the accumulated inverse internal widths, even when the chain length grows without a bound."
